["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Knights vs Ottomans: The Great Siege of Malta Traccia Italiana scorched earth Grand Master corsair\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-17-historyhit-奥斯曼四万大军围攻马耳他-为何败给几百骑士/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9f68700f4e1f904-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">28:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0917</span></div>\n<h2>奧斯曼四萬大軍圍攻馬耳他，為何敗給幾百騎士</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1565 年奧斯曼艦隊 180 艘船、四萬人圍攻馬耳他，守軍只有約 500 名騎士和幾千馬耳他人。聖埃爾莫堡硬撐一個月後陷落，但拖到九月西西里援軍登陸，奧斯曼人撤退。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">軍事</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"706. Queen Victoria’s Revenge: Storming the Citadel (Part 2) Maria Theresa thaler Snider breech-loading rifle khaki Ferenjis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-restishistory-英国远征埃塞俄比亚-一场用铁路和大象打赢的人质危机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d9d0cedd270ca9a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>英國遠征埃塞俄比亞：一場用鐵路和大象打贏的人質危機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1868年英國為救幾十名人質，花掉一千萬英鎊、運去44頭大象和20英里鐵軌，用後膛槍對長矛打出一場屠殺——然後立刻撤走，留下埃塞俄比亞二十年內戰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">帝國史</span><span class=\"tag\">人質危機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.275 澳洲保健品是怎麼火起來的? TGA AUSTL AUSTR GMP CMO / CDMO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-bizthisway-澳洲保健品监管像药-但没人管它有没有效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">39:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商業就是這樣</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>澳洲保健品監管像藥，但沒人管它有沒有效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">澳洲把保健品和藥品放在同一個機構下監管，看上去很嚴格；但功效既不在上市前審查，也不在生產環節被檢驗——「好」的印象是被營銷和跨境政策植入的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">保健品</span><span class=\"tag\">監管套利</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"396. Stalin: The Bolshevik Revolution (Part 2) Cheka political commissar General Secretary White Russians\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-empirehist-列宁设计了恐怖机器-斯大林只是接手了它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">44:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>列寧設計了恐怖機器，斯大林只是接手了它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">秘密警察、勞改營、一黨制都是列寧留下的架構，斯大林做的是把它變成個人權力工具——他當總書記後第一件事就是往關鍵崗位塞自己人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">蘇聯史</span><span class=\"tag\">斯大林</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why You Don&#x27;t Need a Co-Founder to Start | Dave Morin, Offline Ventures Company OS idea maze agentic engineering\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-solofounders-单人创始人不是一个人-关系才是产品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2a0f466f68788060-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">58:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>單人創始人不是一個人：關係才是產品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">85% 的創業公司死於關係沒成，不是產品想法差。單人創始人的真正含義是當個獨奏藝術家，把找關係當成主業，而不是真的一個人扛。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">單人創業</span><span class=\"tag\">創始人關係</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Underwriting Superintelligence: Backing Agents you can Sue — Rune Kvist, AIUC AIUC-1 eval awareness groundedness filter lemon problem CAISI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-latentspace-ai-落地的瓶颈不是能力-是没人敢签字担责/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6979f3df4fdf5281-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:26:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>AI 落地的瓶頸不是能力，是沒人敢簽字擔責</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Waymo 四年前就比人開得好，卻至今進不了機場——約束 AI 有用性的從來不是能力，而是責任、風險和信任。AIUC 想用標準加保險補上這塊信心基礎設施。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 合規</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 保險</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Transplanted human brain-tissue takes root in mice without a cortex organoid pallium xenocortical mice paper to agent AlphaGenome\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-naturepod-人脑类器官移植进小鼠-长出了四百万人类神经元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">28:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>人腦類器官移植進小鼠，長出了四百萬人類神經元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小鼠被基因手段刪掉幾乎整個皮層，植入人腦類器官後長出約400萬人類神經元，行為既不像正常鼠也不像無皮層鼠，而是第三種狀態。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神經科學</span><span class=\"tag\">類器官</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"For Want of a Resistor clock buffer HCSL probe effect 0201 stencil\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-oxideandfriend-一颗三美元的时钟缓冲器-差点让整家计算机公司停摆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/eb3630bdee64e189-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Oxide and Friends</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>一顆三美元的時鐘緩衝器，差點讓整家計算機公司停擺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 需求爆發後，第九代 PCIe 時鐘緩衝器被掃空，替代品又踩中 HCSL 端接的隱蔽差異。最後救回產線的不是芯片，是一顆 0201 電阻。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬件供應鏈</span><span class=\"tag\">PCIe</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Beyond the Hype: Dr. Xiao Liu on Evaluating Medical AI Delphi study CONSORT SPIRIT white dot syndromes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-nejmaigrandrou-ai-评估的混乱不是技术问题-是透明度问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff7071d8628d0546-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">43:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">NEJM AI Grand Rounds</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>AI 評估的混亂不是技術問題，是透明度問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2019 年那篇系統綜述裡，只有不到 5% 的醫學影像 AI 論文達到了其他醫學領域早已確立的嚴謹標準，而表現最好的模型也只是與放射科醫生持平。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">臨床驗證</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Coley&#x27;s Toxins and the Origins of Immunotherapy erysipelas Bacillus prodigiosus BCG tumor necrosis factor (TNF)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-stuffmissed-他用细菌毒素治癌症-被同行骂了四十年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>他用細菌毒素治癌症，被同行罵了四十年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Coley 用鏈球菌毒素讓部分肉瘤患者腫瘤消失，但無法標準化、無法解釋機制，最終被放療和監管擠出局；他的女兒用後半生為這套療法建起了癌症研究所。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫學史</span><span class=\"tag\">癌症免疫治療</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ron Rothblum on Fiat-Shamir Attacks, Flock and SNARK.fast Fiat-Shamir GKR diagonalization polynomial commitment scheme sketched code binary fields\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-zeroknowledge-fiat-shamir-攻击不是误用-是协议本身不安全/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7dca63fe71cd70d3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Z\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Zero Knowledge</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>Fiat-Shamir 攻擊不是誤用，是協議本身不安全</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">GKR 這類真實部署的協議，在標準 Fiat-Shamir 下可被證明假命題為真；這不是實現疏忽，是變換本身的問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">零知識證明</span><span class=\"tag\">Fiat-Shamir</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Annie Lowrey on the Time Tax, Fraud, and Rationing by Paperwork time tax TANF submerged benefits Jevons paradox improper payment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-tyler-政府不只浪费你的钱-还浪费你每周一小时/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0fc39ddaf6ffc3b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">56:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Conversations with Tyler</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>政府不只浪費你的錢，還浪費你每週一小時</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國人不自己報稅的國家有一堆，IRS 卻被法律禁止替你做。時間稅最狠的不是富人，是窮人、移民和進過監獄的人——而 AI 未必救得了他們。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共政策</span><span class=\"tag\">行政負擔</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The AI-Native CRM business world model greenfield / brownfield schema hopium ICP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-a16z-tome-做到-2500-万用户后-他推倒重来去做-crm/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>Tome 做到 2500 萬用戶後，他推倒重來去做 CRM</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Keith Perez 放棄 2500 萬用戶的 Tome，因為團隊自己都不喜歡那個產品；他判斷 CRM 的勝負手不是讓銷售多幹活，而是能不能把公司的客戶現實完整建模。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>16</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CRM</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 原生應用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Are bad teeth the number one reason kids go to A&amp;E? NEET P-Doom dentine\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-moreorless-儿童看急诊第一原因是牙-数字被念错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">28:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>兒童看急診第一原因是牙？數字被唸錯了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英國議員說牙齒問題是兒童進急診的第一原因，實際數字指的是5到18歲因蛀牙住院治療——兩者不是一回事，而蛀牙率其實在緩慢下降。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">事實核查</span><span class=\"tag\">公共衛生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Michael Moritz - Lessons From 40 Years of Investing and Writing - [Invest Like the Best, EP.491] bolt hole monomania collabos great man theory Fleet Street\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-ilt-红杉前掌门看人-14-岁前发生了什么-内核就定了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/099b44b457a7da61-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>紅杉前掌門看人：14 歲前發生了什麼，內核就定了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他挖自己難民家族的歷史後發現，一個人 12、13、14 歲前從父母身上無意識吸收的印記會跟你一輩子；之後變的是外在強度，不是內核。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">早期投資</span><span class=\"tag\">紅杉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Extreme Meteorology (EL NIÑO) with Marshall Shepherd ENSO teleconnection atmospheric rivers jet stream warm blob\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-ologies-最强厄尔尼诺还没到峰值-但没人活着见过它这么大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>最強厄爾尼諾還沒到峰值，但沒人活著見過它這麼大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2026 年的厄爾尼諾在秋季就已超過 1982 和 2015 兩次歷史最強事件的峰值，而它的峰值通常在冬季才到。這不是未來的氣候預測，是正在發生的天氣。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">氣候</span><span class=\"tag\">厄爾尼諾</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How investing is getting riskier (Two Indicators) margin trading margin call single-stock leveraged ETF prediction market\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-planetmoney-保证金债务创纪录-散户正在用借来的钱炒股/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">18:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Planet Money</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>保證金債務創紀錄，散戶正在用借來的錢炒股</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國券商保證金債務已超過全美信用卡債務總額，韓國槓桿 ETF 崩盤讓 36 萬個賬戶被強制清倉，其中多數是 35 歲以下的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">保證金交易</span><span class=\"tag\">槓桿ETF</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ep. 031 - EMERGENCY EPISODE: Are We Doomed? | Jordan Nanos, Doug O&#x27;Laughlin, Max Kan, Joey Brookhart neocloud backwardation P Doom RSI ROSA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-semianalysiswe-安全不是减速带-anthropic-的合规承诺反而要吃掉更多算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d3f66fbf6cfa27e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">SemiAnalysis Weekly</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>安全不是減速帶：Anthropic 的合規承諾反而要吃掉更多算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dario 的「pacing the frontier」被讀成要少買卡，但 OpenAI 光思維鏈監控就花掉 20% 的算力——安全本身是算力密集型產業，需求繼續跑贏供給。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"88.在新加坡，與祥峰鄭俊聰的訪談：硬科技，下一代 Long China 與華人創新的信心史 golden share DPI Singapore Washing eVTOL AI for Science\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-lightstar-投中宇树却错过加注-耐心资本也会被基金周期卡住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ccc5fa65423d3ede-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"衛\"><span class=\"dur\">2:29:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">漫談Light the Star</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>投中宇樹卻錯過加註：耐心資本也會被基金週期卡住</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">祥峰2020年是宇樹Pre-A+輪唯一機構投資人，2023年那輪卻因自家美元基金到期、正在募新基金而沒錢跟投。重倉追投考驗的不只是眼光，還有基金和項目的節奏匹配。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硬科技投資</span><span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"How to Be a Double Unicorn, with John Urschel | Better in Person CTE NIL Cantor&#x27;s Diagonal argument uncountable\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-freakonomics-数学教授和nfl球员-他说自己只是运气好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/31b59d596097facf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">32:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>數學教授和NFL球員，他說自己只是運氣好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">John Urschel 一邊打NFL一邊讀完MIT數學博士，卻說天賦只佔一小部分，自己成功靠的是「極其大量的苦功」和運氣——他甚至希望橄欖球名聲沒幫他拿到MIT教職。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">職業選擇</span><span class=\"tag\">數學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E251｜推理芯片之戰：聊聊Groq、Cerebras與OpenAI三大路徑與Bill Dally的設計哲學 arithmetic intensity roofline model MFU MBU Dark silicon Amdahl&#x27;s Law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-16-sv101-推理芯片绕过cuda是必然-但sram的窗口未必一直开着/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0916</span></div>\n<h2>推理芯片繞過CUDA是必然，但SRAM的窗口未必一直開著</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">訓練拼算力、推理拼帶寬，Groq和Cerebras都押SRAM，但一個為確定性打折、一個為良率打折；OpenAI卻選了最貴的HBM4，因為它缺的是電不是錢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">推理芯片</span><span class=\"tag\">SRAM</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Luke Harding and Alastair Campbell: Trump, Putin and the New Age of Conquest (Part Two) FSB crink axis of upheaval dictator envy AFD\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-iq2-特朗普在莫斯科的档案-比任何政策分析都更能解释他的顺从/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d96b3b64117a97e0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">36:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普在莫斯科的檔案，比任何政策分析都更能解釋他的順從</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">俄羅斯情報機構對特朗普的監視從1970年代就開始了，FSB在麗思卡爾頓酒店24小時駐人。盧克·哈丁認為，這份檔案是理解特朗普對普京態度的關鍵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span><span class=\"tag\">俄羅斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"90% of AI prototypes never reach production (w/ Temporal&#x27;s Samar Abbas) | AI Basics harness durable execution code mode forward deployed engineer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-twist-90-的-ai-原型死在-poc-缺的不是模型是-harness/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8808398669f72c35-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">19:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>90% 的 AI 原型死在 POC：缺的不是模型是 harness</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型再強也扛不住中途崩潰——退款發到一半進程掛了，客戶收到兩筆錢。把狀態從 agent 裡抽出來、交給 harness 託管，才是從筆記本走進生產的分界線。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">持久化執行</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"JD Vance on AI, Entitlement Fraud, Iran War, Israel, H-1B Abuse &amp; the Midterms SNAP NIMBY DOGE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-allin-ai-前沿公司造了弗兰肯斯坦-却找政府要监管/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3ff4664d500d34f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">27:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 前沿公司造了弗蘭肯斯坦，卻找政府要監管</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">萬斯說，如果你在造弗蘭肯斯坦，第一該停下來，第二當企業來要防禦工具時得給他們——而不是把前沿公司自己造的風險外包給全球治理機構。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 監管</span><span class=\"tag\">H-1B</span>\n</div></div></a>"]